
SCENARIO 7: PREVIEW AND APPLY A PLUGIN TO ONE OR MORE TARGET HARNESSES

Common · Shipped

  Use this when you are ready to materialize a known-good setup into a project.
  The dry-run preview is itself a frequent check before a real write.

TYPICAL COMMANDS

  ht apply my-setup --project . --harness claude-code,codex,cursor --dry-run
  ht apply my-setup --project . --harness claude-code,codex,cursor
  ht status .
  ht apply my-setup --strict-plugin-versions   # exit 2 on pin violation
  ht apply my-setup --ignore-plugin-versions   # skip validation

Full doc: https://github.com/harnesstap/harnesstap/blob/main/docs/scenarios/details/07-preview-apply-plugin.md
All scenarios: https://github.com/harnesstap/harnesstap/blob/main/docs/scenarios/scenarios.md
